    "tpa_score_new": "<div>本課程採團隊合作學習方式，課堂參與為評分核心，請修課同學務必全程到課。</div>\n\n<div>評分含期中考試與期末考試，課程總成績的組成如下：</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>項目</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>比例</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>課堂活動</td>\n\t\t\t<td>15%</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>實習課</td>\n\t\t\t<td>15%</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>期中考試</td>\n\t\t\t<td>30%</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>期末考試</td>\n\t\t\t<td>40%</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>重要規範</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>缺考規定：</strong> 若無正當且具證明文件的理由，缺席考試將以零分計算。</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>遲交作業：</strong> 作業遲交在一週內仍可繳交，但成績將以 <strong>七折 (扣除 30%)</strong> 計算。</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div><strong>隨堂測驗：</strong>&nbsp;隨堂測驗 (Kahoot) <strong>不提供補考</strong>。</div>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>You will have one midterm exam and one final exam. The course grade has the following structure:</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Class Activities &amp; Assignments 20&nbsp;%</div>\n\n<div>Scheduled Quizzes 20 %</div>\n\n<div>Midterm Exam 30%</div>\n\n<div>Final Exam 30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Without a valid and documented excuse, you will receive a grade of zero if you miss an&nbsp;exam. Late submission of homework within one week will be accepted but will be counted with 30％ discount. There is no make-up random quiz (Quizizz).</div>\n</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "課堂即時作業：\n各項課堂作業均於課間發佈，且必須在該堂課結束前繳交。逾時繳交者概不受理。\n\n缺考處理：\n若無正當且具證明文件的理由，缺席考試將以零分計算。\n\n出席要求：\n本課程要求學生必須出席，請務必準時到課，隨堂測驗錯過不予以補考。",
    "course_pol_en": "1.\tEach random quiz (playing Quizizz) will be given in class and should be submitted before the end of that class. No late submission will be accepted.\n\n2.     Without a valid and documented excuse, you will receive a grade of zero if you miss an exam.\n\n3.\tAttendance is required in this class. Be sure to attend the class on time.",
    "course_rem": "請遵守相關空間使用規定，若本課程某些方面造成您學習困難，請盡快告知，一起找出方法改善。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<table>\n\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<th>綜合說明</th>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>1. 教材與公告 (Course Materials &amp; Announcements)</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div>本課程之教學教材（包含授課投影片、學習單及預習教材）均會上傳至 <strong>iLearn 2.0 平台 (<a href=\"http://ilearn.fcu.edu.tw\" target=\"_blank\">http://ilearn.fcu.edu.tw</a>)</strong>。此外，所有重要公告與課程作業亦會同步於該平台發布。</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div><strong>定期查閱：</strong> 請務必定期登入平台確認資訊。</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div><strong>課前預習：</strong> 同學須在課前先行閱讀預習教材，以提升課堂學習成效。</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div>2. 學術誠信 (Academic Integrity)</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div>本課程對<strong>作弊行為採取零容忍政策</strong>。若經查證屬實，違規者須自行承擔校方懲處及成績計算之所有後果。</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;Class materials including lecture slides , worksheets and practice questions will be placed in the learning system:<strong>&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"http://ilearn2.fcu.edu.tw/\"><strong>http://ilearn.fcu.edu.tw</strong></a>. Important announcements and coursework are posted here as well. Be sure to check it on the regular basis. Reading the lecture slides before the class is strongly recommended.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>2. Cheating will not be tolerated in this class and you will take the all consequence if you do.&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
